<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-23T07:47:20.153Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:47:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have charged a prosecutor with treason for alleged US involvement in a drug raid, while a Texas man was indicted for a weapons conspiracy linked to the Sinaloa Cartel. A Sinaloa Cartel transporter pleaded guilty to trafficking methamphetamine and marijuana, and another smuggler admitted moving tens of thousands of pounds of drugs in federal court. The AI-powered intel platform that tracked El Mencho is now being used to locate the next cartel boss after reports of his death. Three Mexican men were extradited to Milwaukee after a $17 million cocaine bust on a U.S. yacht off Costa Rica. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/0ce7d049-b264-47da-9aaa-08b33941585a?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOT0F0SE1lQkdGR2w3SEtrcFNXRmFvSHdISmtuMmVDdXIySGkxOHBjQk1RSTJjVG5KUHY5bTF6c3dXdGplWjB5RVAxNzNrc0lfUjN6bEtrZ29jbWtQNWJyNkJEMmNvdDIyWk1UVGowVkhfYVBabExtTFJSRGpZSUJPOFFlcjFSSFFTUTYwX3AzNWNnbXZ6YjhreHp1Z3dHdHY1SU4yS1Y5Nk10SktmUkkxNmJxUHZ2S3BWSnFMRmV1cjAwOGZS?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Heartland Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;7NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOM1ZPSi1KaUdRZUhlUXAxRXV5RUhCbk4tZXN3bXZOZDRpck5IeDNvcmNFc0w2bVNlbVlpb0JfWm1yOXBnZHJLU294cG5fTllGOGxsQXVJTTEtbkJSTVdPTE5VeE1TcjNkMkwwZ3o1a2dra0lkQXhrclNQSmhzRW1HSWRNLVZEbGdlX3JuTjZMY0xZZXZqZzM4dDFGZ3VRc1RHMUZrUGxSa1pBUUpIRFktS2NYcnpNM2xjb1ZES0l6Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxONDZGcWU1cXhVaWRQVi10d3V1YURxLW1GVTRwSkhmeU5VUnhmLVNvbmJPX0oxTE5SYmp2Um83T1VNSWZYVVc4RDBscXJ3UGZMeTJ2cEU